{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# The FSoV scalar product for the twisted gl(4) L=2 chain\n\n`[S,S,0,0] x [P,P,0,0]` sites, inhomogeneities `theta1, theta2`, shift `h`, diagonal twist `z_j`.\n\nThis notebook contains only the **final, validated** construction of the separated-variables scalar\nproduct and the proof-by-computation that eigenstates are orthogonal:\n\n$$\\mathcal M^{AB}_{(\\alpha,i,j),(r,\\beta)} = \\oint_{\\mathcal C} du\\ E_1(u)\\, e^{2\\pi i u(\\alpha-1)/h}\\, u^{\\beta}\\, \\big[\\hat q^{\\,j}_A \\hat q^{\\,B}_i\\big]_r(u)\\ ,\\qquad \\det \\mathcal M^{AB} = 0 \\iff A \\neq B\\ .$$\n\nThe derivation is in `SU4_SoV_ScalarProduct_L2.tex`; a symbol-by-symbol reference is in\n`SU4_SoV_ScalarProduct_L2.md`. The exploratory work, including the dead ends, lives in\n`../Experiments/SU4_twisted_Baxter_L2.wb` (Sections 11-12).\n\n**Requirements.** The twist must be **unimodular**, `z1 z2 z3 z4 = 1`, and the `z_j` distinct.\n\nRun the cells in order; the notebook is self-contained.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Twist, Yangian weights, transfer matrices ---------------------------------------- *)\nClearAll[z, χ, zvars, ν, ν1, qdet, Ξ, subl, Dn, τ, τ3quad, tc, tcvars];\nzvars = Table[z[j], {j, 4}];\nχ[a_] := χ[a] = Total[(Times @@ #) & /@ Subsets[zvars, {a}]];\n\n(* nu_i(u) = Prod_alpha (u - theta_alpha - h lambda^alpha_i); rectangular reps collapse these to two *)\nν[S_, P_][i_][u_] := (u - θ1 - h {S, S, 0, 0}[[i]]) (u - θ2 - h {P, P, 0, 0}[[i]]);\nν1[S_, P_][u_] := ν[S, P][1][u];\nqdet[S_, P_][u_] := χ[4] Product[ν[S, P][i][u - (4 - i) h], {i, 4}];\n\n(* subleading coefficient of tau_a: a twist prefactor times chi_a, plus h times the weights acting on chi_a *)\nΞ[a_, n_List] := Total[((Times @@ (z /@ #)) Total[n[[#]]]) & /@ Subsets[Range[4], {a}]];\nsubl[a_, n_List] := -a (θ1 + θ2 + (a - 1) h) χ[a] - h Ξ[a, n];\n\ntcvars = Table[tc[i], {i, 5}];\nτ[1][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := χ[1] u^2 + subl[1, μ] u + tc[1];\nτ[2][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := χ[2] u^4 + subl[2, μ] u^3 + tc[2] u^2 + tc[3] u + tc[4];\nτ3quad[S_, P_, μ_] := τ3quad[S, P, μ] = Module[{x, bb, expr},\n   expr = Expand[ν[S, P][1][x - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][x] (χ[3] x^2 + bb x + tc[5])];\n   Simplify[bb /. First@Solve[Coefficient[expr, x, 5] == subl[3, μ], bb]]];\nτ[3][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := ν[S, P][1][u - 2 h] ν[S, P][4][u] (χ[3] u^2 + τ3quad[S, P, μ] u + tc[5]);\nτ[4][S_, P_, μ_][u_] := qdet[S, P][u];\n\n\"1. twist and transfer matrices loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961317\" data-output-id=\"91\" data-out-n=\"15\" data-sub-idx=\"17\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"23\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[15]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"28\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MS4gdHdpc3QgYW5kIHRyYW5zZmVyIG1hdHJpY2VzIGxvYWRlZH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1. twist and transfer matrices loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[15]= \\text{1. twist and transfer matrices loaded}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
