   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. The Baxter operator, its dual, and the Q-functions\n\nDividing the Baxter equation by $\\prod_{m=0}^{3}\\nu_1(u-mh)$ and setting $G(u)=Q(u+h)$ gives the\nfourth-order operator, with $T_{a,1} = \\tau_a$:\n\n$$\\mathcal O = 1 - \\frac{T_{1,1}}{\\nu_1}\\mathcal D^{-1} + \\frac{T_{2,1}}{\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}}\\mathcal D^{-2} - \\frac{T_{3,1}}{\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}}\\mathcal D^{-3} + \\frac{T_{4,1}}{\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}\\nu_1^{[-4]}\\nu_1^{[-6]}}\\mathcal D^{-4}\\ ,$$\n\n$$\\mathcal O^\\dagger = 1 - \\frac{T_{1,1}^{[2]}}{\\nu_4^{[2]}}\\mathcal D^{1} + \\frac{T_{2,1}^{[4]}}{\\nu_4^{[2]}\\nu_4^{[4]}}\\mathcal D^{2} - \\frac{T_{3,1}^{[6]}}{\\nu_4^{[2]}\\nu_4^{[4]}\\nu_4^{[6]}}\\mathcal D^{3} + \\frac{T_{4,1}^{[8]}}{\\nu_4^{[2]}\\nu_4^{[4]}\\nu_4^{[6]}\\nu_4^{[8]}}\\mathcal D^{4}\\ ,$$\n\nwith $f^{[\\pm 2n]}(u) = f(u\\pm nh)$. The two families of solutions are\n\n$$\\hat q_i(u) = z_i^{u/h} q_i(u)\\ ,\\quad \\deg q_i = M_i = (S+P)-\\mu_i\\ ,\\qquad \\mathcal O\\, \\hat q_i^{[2]} = 0\\ ,$$\n\n$$\\hat q^{\\,j}(u) = (-1)^j \\zeta_{\\bar\\jmath}^{(u-h)/h}\\,\\frac{W_{\\bar\\jmath}}{V_{\\bar\\jmath} A}(u-h)\\ ,\\quad \\deg \\hat q^{\\,j} = \\mu_j\\ ,\\qquad \\mathcal O^\\dagger \\hat q^{\\,j} = 0\\ ,$$\n\nwhere $\\bar\\jmath = \\{1,2,3,4\\}\\setminus\\{j\\}$, $\\zeta_{\\bar\\jmath} = \\prod_{m\\neq j}z_m$, $W_{\\bar\\jmath}$ is the $3\\times3$ Casoratian of the $\\hat q_i$, $V_{\\bar\\jmath}$ its Vandermonde, and\n\n$$A(u) = \\prod_{k=1}^{S}(u-\\theta_1-kh)\\prod_{k=1}^{P}(u-\\theta_2-kh)$$\n\nis the vacuum factor, i.e. the $Q_\\theta$ of the QQ-relation $F(u)\\,Q^4(u-h) = \\det[Q_1(u),Q_2(u-h),Q_3(u-2h)]$ with $F_j(u) = (-1)^j (V_{\\bar\\jmath}/\\zeta_{\\bar\\jmath}) A(u)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. Casoratians, the vacuum factor, and the two families of Q-functions ---------------- *)\nClearAll[Wronsk, Vand, qWronsk, AA, QQfun, qDual, QDual, qhat, qdualhat, tcOf, OpO, OpOd];\ntcOf[r_] := Table[tc[i] -> r[\"tc\"][[i]], {i, 5}];\n\nWronsk[rec_, II_List][x_] := Module[{k = Length[II]}, Det[Table[z[II[[a]]]^(k - b) qpoly[rec[\"q\"][[II[[a]]]], x - (b - 1) h], {a, k}, {b, k}]]];\nVand[II_List] := Product[z[II[[a]]] - z[II[[b]]], {a, Length[II]}, {b, a + 1, Length[II]}];\nqWronsk[rec_, II_List][x_] := Cancel[Together[Wronsk[rec, II][x]/Vand[II]]];\nAA[SS_, PP_][x_] := Product[x - θ1 - j h, {j, SS}] Product[x - θ2 - j h, {j, PP}];\n\n(* q_i and its Hodge dual q^j. Every RHS on ONE line: a definition split over lines is silently truncated here. *)\nQQfun[r_, sub_][j_][y_] := (z[j] /. sub)^(y/(h /. sub)) qpoly[r[\"q\"][[j]] /. sub, y];\nqDual[SS_, PP_, r_, sub_][j_][v_] := Cancel[Together[(qWronsk[r, Complement[{1, 2, 3, 4}, {j}]][v + (h /. sub)]/AA[SS, PP][v + (h /. sub)]) /. sub]];\nQDual[SS_, PP_, r_, sub_][j_][v_] := (-1)^j Product[z[i] /. sub, {i, Complement[{1, 2, 3, 4}, {j}]}]^(v/(h /. sub)) qDual[SS, PP, r, sub][j][v];\n\nqhat[r_, sub_][i_][y_] := QQfun[r, sub][i][y];\nqdualhat[SS_, PP_, r_, sub_][j_][y_] := QDual[SS, PP, r, sub][j][y - (h /. sub)];\n\n(* the operators *)\nOpO[SS_, PP_, mu_, r_][G_][x_] := G[x] - (τ[1][SS, PP, mu][x] /. tcOf[r])/ν1[SS, PP][x] G[x - h] + (τ[2][SS, PP, mu][x] /. tcOf[r])/(ν1[SS, PP][x] ν1[SS, PP][x - h]) G[x - 2 h] - (τ[3][SS, PP, mu][x] /. tcOf[r])/(ν1[SS, PP][x] ν1[SS, PP][x - h] ν1[SS, PP][x - 2 h]) G[x - 3 h] + (τ[4][SS, PP, mu][x] /. tcOf[r])/Product[ν1[SS, PP][x - m h], {m, 0, 3}] G[x - 4 h];\nOpOd[SS_, PP_, mu_, r_][G_][x_] := G[x] - (τ[1][SS, PP, mu][x + h] /. tcOf[r])/ν[SS, PP][4][x + h] G[x + h] + (τ[2][SS, PP, mu][x + 2 h] /. tcOf[r])/(ν[SS, PP][4][x + h] ν[SS, PP][4][x + 2 h]) G[x + 2 h] - (τ[3][SS, PP, mu][x + 3 h] /. tcOf[r])/Product[ν[SS, PP][4][x + m h], {m, 3}] G[x + 3 h] + (τ[4][SS, PP, mu][x + 4 h] /. tcOf[r])/Product[ν[SS, PP][4][x + m h], {m, 4}] G[x + 4 h];\n\n\"3. Q-functions and operators loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961317\" data-output-id=\"93\" data-out-n=\"39\" data-sub-idx=\"16\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[39]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"28\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7My4gUS1mdW5jdGlvbnMgYW5kIG9wZXJhdG9ycyBsb2FkZWR9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3. Q-functions and operators loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
